{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undead growls are heard in the distance, and you start to realize that undead zombies are approaching your location. You equip your weapon and fortify the windows as quickly as you can, but time is running out quickly.\u00a0  Can you survive the zombie outbreak?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZOMBIE SURVIVAL MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-Based Survival Mode sets your main objective to surviving for as long as possible.\u00a0 With every passing second,\u00a0 more zombie growls are heard and pretty soon they're all around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with your pistol and explore your environment to find weapons that are better equipped to fight the zombie outbreak. Open doors around the environment to visit new locations and acquire new weapons as your find them.\u00a0 Take advantage of powerups and zombie traps to improve your chances of surviving.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn achievements as you survive and rise up the Steam Leaderboards as you fight the zombies to set a new high score.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-Based Zombie Survival Mode</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Controller Support for PlayStation and Xbox Controllers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927150?t=1754450330","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927150?t=1754450330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927150/04d7671aa9eaf05de8f38f13ded712923